# Admin Panel System (Canonical Reference)

Use this rule for all **Admin Panel** work (`/admin/*`). Admin UI mirrors the Warehouse Panel design language but uses the **`adm-*`** prefix and `AdminPanel.css`.

**Customer/storefront** → `.cursor/rules/home-design-system.mdc`  
**Warehouse panel** → `.cursor/rules/dashboard-panel-design-system.mdc` (`wm-*`)  
**Admin panel** → this rule (`adm-*`)

## Canonical files

| Layer | Path |
|-------|------|
| Layout shell | `front_end/src/layouts/AdminLayout.js`, `styles/layouts/AdminLayout.css` |
| Sidebar | `front_end/src/layouts/Sidebar.js`, `styles/layouts/Sidebar.css` |
| Shared panel CSS | `front_end/src/styles/pages/admin/AdminPanel.css` |
| Page header | `front_end/src/components/PageHeader.js`, `styles/shared/PageDesign.css` |
| Global modal overlay | `styles/shared/AdminPageDesign.css` (via `App.css`) |
| Tokens | `styles/App.css` |
| Routes | `front_end/src/App.js` |
| API config | `front_end/src/config/api.js` |
| HTTP client | `front_end/src/services/http.js` |
| i18n helper | `front_end/src/i18n/uiText.js` → `tUi(key)` |
| Locales | `front_end/src/locales/{en,ar,fr}/common.json` |
| Backend auth | `app/routers/admin.py`, `app/routers/admin_settings.py` |

## Architecture

### Layout DOM
```
.admin-layout
  Navbar
  .admin-container
    aside.sidebar
    main.admin-content  ← route outlet (margin-inline-start: 250px)
```

- Sidebar fixed **250px**; content uses **logical** offset (`margin-inline-start`) for LTR + RTL.
- **≤1024px:** sidebar → horizontal scroll nav; content full width.
- **≤768px:** reduced content padding.

### Routing & roles

| Path | Guard | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| `/admin/*` | `requireAdmin` | `admin` **or** `operations_manager` |
| `/support/*` | support manager | Same `AdminLayout`, different pages |
| `/warehouse/*` | warehouse manager | Same layout, `wm-*` pages |
| `/seller/*` | seller | Reuses some admin components (e.g. `AdminCategories`, `AdminPromotions`) |

**Operations manager:** reduced sidebar (orders, installments, deliveries); dashboard hides catalog stats/actions (`AdminDashboard.js`).

**Sidebar menus:** `ADMIN_MENU_ITEMS`, `OPERATIONS_MANAGER_MENU_ITEMS`, etc. in `Sidebar.js`. Labels via `ui.sidebar.menu.*`, panel title via `ui.sidebar.panel.*`. Drag-reorder persisted in `localStorage`.

### Backend role dependencies (`app/routers/admin.py`)

| Helper | Roles |
|--------|-------|
| `require_admin` | admin |
| `require_admin_or_operations_manager` | admin, operations_manager |
| `require_admin_or_support_manager` | admin, support_manager |
| `require_admin_or_warehouse_manager` | admin, warehouse_manager |
| `require_seller_or_admin` | admin, seller, warehouse_manager |

Settings: `/admin/settings` in `admin_settings.py` (low-stock threshold, warehouse address).

## Page shell & naming

### Required structure (new admin pages)
```jsx
<div className="admin-page-shell adm-page adm-{feature}-page">
  <PageHeader kicker title subtitle actions />
  <section className="adm-{short}-section">
    <div className="adm-{short}-section-header"><h2>…</h2></div>
    {/* toolbar | data-panel | list | empty */}
  </section>
</div>
```

### CSS imports (modern pages)
```js
import '../../styles/pages/admin/AdminPanel.css';  // always
import '../../styles/pages/admin/Admin{Page}.css'; // page-specific
```

### Prefix rules

| Prefix | Use |
|--------|-----|
| `admin-page-shell` | Required wrapper on every panel page |
| `adm-page` | Flex column shell, gap, max-width |
| `adm-*` | Shared primitives in `AdminPanel.css` (stats, buttons, modals) |
| `adm-{short}-*` | Page-scoped classes — **never** bare `.card`, `.stat-card` |
| `admin-*` | **Legacy** — avoid for new work (`AdminPageDesign.css`) |

### Page inventory

| Page | Route | Shell class | CSS prefix |
|------|-------|-------------|------------|
| Dashboard | `/admin` | `adm-dashboard` | `adm-stat-*`, `adm-action-*` |
| Products | `/admin/products` | `adm-products-page` | `adm-products-*` |
| Categories | `/admin/categories` | `adm-categories-page` | `adm-cat-*` |
| Discounts | `/admin/discounts` | `adm-discounts-page` | `adm-discount-*` |
| Promotions | `/admin/promotions` | `adm-promotions-page` | `adm-promo-*` |
| Orders | `/admin/orders` | `adm-orders-page` | `adm-orders-*` |
| Installments | `/admin/installments` | `adm-inst-page` | `adm-inst-*` |
| Deliveries | `/admin/deliveries` | `adm-del-page` | `adm-del-*` |
| Users | `/admin/users` | `adm-users-page` | `adm-users-*` |
| User details | `/admin/users/:id` | `adm-udetail-page` | `adm-udetail-*` |
| Tickets | `/admin/tickets` | `adm-tkt-page` | `adm-tkt-*` |
| Reviews | `/admin/comments` | `adm-reviews-page` | `adm-reviews-*` |
| Feedback | `/admin/feedback` | `admin-feedback` | `adm-fb-*` |

**Legacy (do not copy):** `AdminPosAnalytics.js` — old `stats-grid` / no `AdminPanel.css`.

## UI patterns — reuse before inventing

| Pattern | Reference page |
|---------|----------------|
| Dashboard stats + quick actions | `AdminDashboard.js` |
| PageHeader + header filters | `AdminOrders.js`, `AdminUsers.js` |
| Toolbar + search + pill filters | `AdminProducts.js`, `AdminCategories.js` |
| Data table in rounded panel | `AdminOrders.js` (`.adm-orders-data-panel`) |
| Master–detail (catalog → detail) | `AdminComments.js`, `AdminFeedback.js` |
| Expandable list cards | `AdminTickets.js` |
| Inline create/edit + list | `AdminPromotions.js`, `AdminDiscounts.js` |
| CRUD modal | `AdminProducts.js`, `AdminDashboard.js` (threshold) |
| Confirm before delete | `AdminProducts.js`, `AdminCategories.js` |

### PageHeader
```jsx
<PageHeader
  kicker={t('ui.sidebar.panel.admin')}
  title={tUi('ui.pages.admin.adminOrders.title_...')}
  subtitle={tUi('ui.pages.admin.adminOrders.subtitle_...')}
  actions={<>…</>}
/>
```

### Loading / empty
```jsx
<div className="page-loading adm-page-loading"><LoadingSpinner size="large" /></div>
<div className="adm-{page}-empty"><p>{tUi('...')}</p></div>  // dashed border, centered
```

### Header CTA buttons (match Add Product)
- Class: `adm-btn-primary` / `adm-btn-secondary`
- Use `motion.button` + `FaPlus` for create actions
- Sizing: `.adm-page .page-header-actions .adm-btn-primary` in `AdminPanel.css` (`1rem` font, `0.65rem 1.5rem` padding, `min-height: 44px`)
- Do **not** override with page-specific create-btn classes

### Modals
- Overlay: `.admin-modal-overlay` → card: `.admin-modal`
- Fields: `.adm-modal-field`, `.adm-modal-hint`, `.adm-modal-actions`
- Product modal: `AdminProductsModal.css`

## Styling language

Typography, colors, cards, motion — same as dashboard rule (Space Grotesk + Fraunces, CSS variables, soft `1.2rem` radius, `0.3s ease` hovers).

### Admin-specific layout
- Default max-width: **1200px** (`.adm-page`)
- Catalog pages (dashboard, products, promotions, discounts, categories): **1400px** → **1600px** at `≥1600px`
- Dashboard page gap: **2rem** (tighter); other pages: **4rem** (`2.5rem` mobile)
- Stats grid: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr))`
- Actions grid: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr))` — auto-fill on large screens, 1 col ≤768px
- List grids: `repeat(auto-fill, minmax(300–340px, 1fr))` at `≥1280px` / `≥1600px`

### Buttons
- **Primary:** `.adm-btn-primary` — pill, `var(--primary-color)`, hover lift
- **Secondary:** `.adm-btn-secondary` — pill, bordered surface
- Card/row actions may use smaller overrides (e.g. `0.8rem`) — scoped to `.adm-*-card-actions`, not page headers

### RTL & dark mode
- Logical properties: `margin-inline-start`, `inset-inline-*`, `text-align: start`
- Mirror arrows: `html[dir='rtl'] .adm-action-card-arrow { transform: scaleX(-1); }`
- Toast: RTL position in `App.js` (`top-left` when RTL)
- Dark: override per page under `.dark`; never `var(--text-primary)` on light overlay pills

### CSS file layout
```
styles/pages/admin/
  AdminPanel.css          ← shared adm-* primitives
  Admin{Page}.css         ← page-scoped adm-{short}-*
  AdminProductsPage.css   ← products shell overrides only
  AdminProductsModal.css  ← product modal only
  AdminPromotionsPage.css ← promotions shell overrides only
```

**Products note:** `AdminProducts.css` uses `font: inherit` on buttons **except** `.adm-btn-primary`/`.adm-btn-secondary`.

